                <pb facs="0326" n="278" sameAs="frus:frus1877/pg278"/>

                <head>No. 147.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pierrepont to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-11-30"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 30,
                        1876</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Home office have ordered arrest of Winslow, Brent, and Gray.</p>
                <p>Winslow not here; disappeared early October. Brent here. Gray expected from
                    Paris.</p>
                <p>Foreign office prompt, careful j earnest to surrender.</p>
                <p>Will keep you advised.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <closer><signed>PIERREPONT.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
